---
import { demoCta, site } from '../../lib/site';
// Rows are hand-written (not a mapped array) because the founder row
// carries a live tel: link — the page's one checkable promise.
---

<!-- The hairline breaks the same-background adjacency with the demo above;
     BuiltAround below carries its own for the why → built seam. -->
<section id="why" class="container-page grid gap-12 border-t border-hairline py-section lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] lg:gap-20">
	<div data-reveal>
		<p class="eyebrow">Why us</p>
		<h2 class="mt-4 text-h2 font-semibold">Why this instead of the big platforms</h2>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-lede text-ink-soft">
			The big platforms handle proposals, contracts, invoices, everything for everyone. The
			kitchen side is an afterthought, and you pay for the whole suite to get it. The
			enterprise tools? Built for chains with an IT department.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-lede text-ink-soft">
			Neither one sweats the production math, and that&rsquo;s the part that ruins your
			Friday. It&rsquo;s the only thing I build, and kitchens your size are the only
			kitchens I build it for.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="lg:mt-2">
		<ul role="list">
			<li class="py-6 lg:py-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
				<h3 class="text-h3 font-semibold">It counts like a cook</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-ink-soft">
					Twelve years on the line went into how this thing counts. It knows about yield
					and trim, and it knows your caper-lemon butter is its own recipe living inside
					another one.
				</p>
			</li>
			<li class="border-t border-hairline py-6 lg:py-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 150ms">
				<h3 class="text-h3 font-semibold">You get me</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-ink-soft">
					Call <a href={site.phoneHref} class="font-medium text-green-deep underline decoration-current underline-offset-4">{site.phone}</a> and I pick up.
					No ticket queue, no support tiers.
				</p>
			</li>
			<li class="border-t border-hairline py-6 lg:py-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 220ms">
				<h3 class="text-h3 font-semibold">You don&rsquo;t do data entry</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-ink-soft">
					Text me photos of your recipe binder, sauce splatter and all. The software
					reads the cards, I do the rest by hand, and you&rsquo;re costing orders the
					same week.
				</p>
			</li>
			<li class="border-t border-hairline py-6 lg:py-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 290ms">
				<h3 class="text-h3 font-semibold">About that spreadsheet</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-ink-soft">
					You know the one. Somebody built it years ago, somebody broke a formula last
					spring, and now everyone keeps their own copy and prays. This replaces it.
				</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<a
			href={demoCta.href}
			target={demoCta.target}
			rel={demoCta.rel}
			aria-label="Book 15 minutes with your own order (opens in a new tab)"
			class="btn-quiet mt-2"
		>
			Book 15 minutes with your own order
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
